---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="pt-16 pb-16 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-32" id="get-started">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
                <h2 class="lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-6 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.title">Payroll works. But how?</h2>
                <p data-garna-subtitle class="text-xl font-light text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.description">With simple steps, we transformed the working process into a system that works seamlessly on autopilot</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-16 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:gap-16">
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <div class="relative pl-14">
                        <div class="absolute left-5 top-11 bottom-[-2rem] w-px bg-white/10"></div>
                        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300] bg-[#050505] text-sm font-semibold text-[#CBF300] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.3)]">1</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.setup.title">Set Up Your Team and Payroll Structure</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.setup.description">Get your company set up, get your employees and contractors on board, sort out job roles and get your payroll workflows sorted out to suit your business</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative pl-14">
                        <div class="absolute left-5 top-11 bottom-[-2rem] w-px bg-white/10"></div>
                        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300] bg-[#050505] text-sm font-semibold text-[#CBF300] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.3)]">2</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.automate.title">Automate Calculations and Taxes</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.automate.description">Our platform does all the hard work: calculate payments, taxes, any deductions, and invoices, according to configured rules and law requirements</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative pl-14">
                        <div class="absolute left-5 top-11 bottom-[-2rem] w-px bg-white/10"></div>
                        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300] bg-[#050505] text-sm font-semibold text-[#CBF300] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.3)]">3</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.run.title">Run Payroll and Payments</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.run.description">Get your payroll sorted, fund your account, and send out payments to people in different countries with our flexible payment options in a few clicks</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative pl-14">
                        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300] bg-[#050505] text-sm font-semibold text-[#CBF300] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.3)]">4</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.track.title">Track, Report, and Scale</h3>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="payrollWorks.steps.track.description">See how your payroll is going through the centralized dashboards, pull off reports in seconds, and increase your payroll infrastructure as your team grows and expands</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#101010] shadow-2xl">
                        <div class="flex h-10 items-center gap-4 border-b border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0A0A0A] px-4">
                            <div class="flex flex-none items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ef4444] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.24)]"></span>
                                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EAB308] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.24)]"></span>
                                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.24)]"></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mx-auto flex h-5 w-64 max-w-[46%] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/[0.05] bg-white/[0.05] text-center font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[#71717a]">
                                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#CBF300] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.45)]"></span>
                                <span>garna.io/payroll</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-10"></div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid gap-4 p-5">
                            <div class="mid-size-payroll-run-header grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-5 py-4 min-[480px]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] min-[480px]:gap-4">
                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                    <p class="truncate text-base font-semibold text-white" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.title">June payroll run</p>
                                    <p class="mt-1 truncate text-xs text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.subtitle">Employees, contractors, taxes, and invoices in one batch</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex min-w-0 max-w-48 items-center gap-2 justify-self-start rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]/12 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#CBF300] min-[480px]:justify-self-end">
                                    <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]"></span>
                                    <span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.readyToApprove">Ready to approve</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.8fr]">
                                <div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4">
                                    <div class="mb-3 grid grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.65fr_0.65fr] gap-3 px-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">
                                        <span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.recipient">Recipient</span>
                                        <span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.type">Type</span>
                                        <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-right" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.netPay">Net pay</span>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="space-y-2">
                                        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.65fr_0.65fr] items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2 text-xs">
                                            <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5">
                                                <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/07-photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f.jpg" alt="Mia Johnson avatar" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                                    <p class="truncate font-medium text-white">Mia Johnson</p>
                                                    <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-[10px] text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.unitedStates">United States</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <span class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-full bg-white/[0.07] px-2 py-1 text-center text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.employee">Employee</span>
                                            <span class="text-right font-semibold text-white">$6,420</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.65fr_0.65fr] items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2 text-xs">
                                            <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5">
                                                <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/03-83a1ae5f-c842-4ee9-a912-505fc66a1ee0_320w.webp" alt="Luis Ortega avatar" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                                    <p class="truncate font-medium text-white">Luis Ortega</p>
                                                    <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-[10px] text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.spain">Spain</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <span class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-full bg-white/[0.07] px-2 py-1 text-center text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.contractor">Contractor</span>
                                            <span class="text-right font-semibold text-white">€4,850</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.65fr_0.65fr] items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-[#CBF300]/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs">
                                            <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5">
                                                <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/08-photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb.jpg" alt="Ava Martins avatar" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                                    <p class="truncate font-medium text-white">Ava Martins</p>
                                                    <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-[10px] text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.portugal">Portugal</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <span class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]/15 px-2 py-1 text-center text-[#CBF300]" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.employee">Employee</span>
                                            <span class="text-right font-semibold text-white">€5,100</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.65fr_0.65fr] items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2 text-xs">
                                        <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5">
                                            <img src="/pages/payroll-solution-new/assets/05-f8322831-e2ba-4007-9960-8e7e82b00480_320w.webp" alt="Nadia Lee avatar" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                                            <div class="min-w-0">
                                                <p class="truncate font-medium text-white">Nadia Lee</p>
                                                <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-[10px] text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.singapore">Singapore</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-full bg-white/[0.07] px-2 py-1 text-center text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.contractor">Contractor</span>
                                        <span class="text-right font-semibold text-white">$3,880</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-xs">
                                        <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                            <p class="truncate text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.recipients">Recipients</p>
                                            <p class="mt-1 truncate font-semibold text-white" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.synced4">4 synced</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                            <p class="truncate text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.countries">Countries</p>
                                            <p class="mt-1 truncate font-semibold text-white" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.active4">4 active</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                            <p class="truncate text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.fxCheck">FX check</p>
                                            <p class="mt-1 truncate font-semibold text-white" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.ready">Ready</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
                                        <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2.5">
                                            <p class="truncate text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.payrollGroups">Payroll groups</p>
                                            <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.employees">Employees</span>
                                                <span class="font-semibold text-white">2</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.contractors">Contractors</span>
                                                <span class="font-semibold text-white">2</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2.5">
                                            <p class="truncate text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.reviewQueue">Review queue</p>
                                            <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.invoices">Invoices</span>
                                                <span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-[#CBF300]" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.clear">Clear</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.approvals">Approvals</span>
                                                <span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-[#CBF300]" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.ready">Ready</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="mid-size-payroll-side-grid grid h-full gap-4 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr]">
                                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4">
                                        <p class="truncate text-xs text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.batchTotal">Batch total</p>
                                        <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">$112,272</p>
                                        <div class="mt-4 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10">
                                            <div class="mid-size-payroll-progress h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]"></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-between text-[10px] text-gray-500">
                                            <span class="truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.funded">Funded</span>
                                            <span class="text-[#CBF300]">86%</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs">
                                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                                <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-300">
                                                    <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]"></span>
                                                    <span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.employees">Employees</span>
                                                </span>
                                                <span class="font-semibold text-white">$72.4k</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                                <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-300">
                                                    <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]"></span>
                                                    <span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.contractors">Contractors</span>
                                                </span>
                                                <span class="font-semibold text-white">$39.8k</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="mid-size-payroll-approval-card flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4">
                                        <p class="truncate text-xs text-gray-500" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.approvalStatus">Approval status</p>
                                        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
                                            <div class="flex justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.payrollRules">Payroll rules</span>
                                                <span class="mid-size-payroll-status shrink-0 text-[#CBF300]" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.checked">Checked</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.taxWorkflow">Tax workflow</span>
                                                <span class="mid-size-payroll-status shrink-0 text-[#CBF300]" style="animation-delay: 0.45s;" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.ready">Ready</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.invoices">Invoices</span>
                                                <span class="mid-size-payroll-status shrink-0 text-[#CBF300]" style="animation-delay: 0.9s;" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.matched">Matched</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2 xl:hidden">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.documents">Documents</span>
                                                <span class="mid-size-payroll-status shrink-0 text-[#CBF300]" style="animation-delay: 1.35s;" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.signed">Signed</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] px-3 py-2 xl:hidden">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-300" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.payouts">Payouts</span>
                                                <span class="mid-size-payroll-status shrink-0 text-[#CBF300]" style="animation-delay: 1.8s;" data-translate="payrollWorksVisual.queued">Queued</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
